Please don't, without asking first:
- copy, redistribute or re-upload the program, the app or the website, or parts of them;
- change it, rebrand it, or pass it off as your own;
- reuse its code, design or layout to make another app or website.

If you'd like to use something, just ask: https://github.com/nairck/ClassicHandbook/issues
I'm happy to hear ideas and requests.

